  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "From conservation of linear momentum we can see that velocity of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> block just after collision is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math> leftwards.<br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0021541_sol.JPG\" style=\"width: 270px; height: 69px;\" /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/0021541_sol_1.JPG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 54px;\" /><br /><br />Now relative velocity of approach = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br />and relative velocity of separation = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>e</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>Relative velocity of separation</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>Relative velocity of approach</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>1</mn></mrow></math>",
    "image": null
  },
